<title>AUSTRALIA: RUGBY LEAGUE-BRITAIN BEAT FIJI PRESIDENT'S XIII 42-16.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-BRITAIN BEAT FIJI PRESIDENT'S XIII 42-16.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain beat a Fiji President's</p>
<p>XIII 42-16 (halftime 26-0) in in a rugby league tour match</p>
<p>played in Lautoka, Fiji, on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Britain - Tries: K Hammond (3), J Hayes, T Tollett, K</p>
<p>Senior, M Cassidy, J Critchley. Goals: S Prescott (5)</p>
<p>Fiji President's XIII - Tries: J Koroi, P Baravilala, E</p>
<p>Navale. Goals: I Takaladau (2)</p>
</text>
